  "bodyHash": "58337d2fc2a81027",
  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><h2><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>以从未有过的姿态探索我的世界！</em></span></h2></div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gimlIM5.png\" alt=\"Aerobatic Elytra\" width=\"854\"></span></p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=Minceraft&message=1.16 - 1.20.1&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=4e4e4e&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Minecraft: 1.16 - 1.20.1\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/loader-(Neo)Forge-cc9b6a?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Mod Loader: (Neo)Forge\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/side-Client & Server-15c77a?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Side: Client &amp; Server\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/endorh/aerobatic-elytra\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=4078c0&labelColor=4e4e4e&style=for-the-badge&logo=github\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/gqYVjBq65U\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1017484317636710520?color=5865F2&label=&labelColor=4e4e4e&logo=discord&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Join the Discord\"></a></p></div><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">📖 <strong>关于</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在游戏中添加了一种新的鞘翅物品，可以像飞机一样飞行，并使用火箭作为燃料进行推进。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本质上，这是一个我的世界中的飞行模拟器。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">✅ <strong>主要特性</strong></span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>像飞机一样飞翔！</strong></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用烟花自定义<strong>轨迹</strong>（每个火箭对应一种）<span style=\"color:#999\">(每支火箭各一种)</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可使用<strong>染料</strong>和<strong>旗帜</strong>自定义翅膀（类似于 <a style=\"color:#999\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customizable-elytra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Customizable Elytra</a>）</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通过冲刺来<strong>加速</strong>以获得更高速度</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通过蹲下<strong>刹车</strong>帮助着陆</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在粘液块上<strong>弹跳</strong></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">飞行时<strong>环顾四周</strong>（同时也可用弓瞄准）</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通过<strong>数据包</strong>扩展功能（包括可通过命令安装的内置示例）</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">按快捷键切换至<strong>原版鞘翅飞行模式</strong>（如果服务器允许）</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">其他模组可能添加<strong>新飞行模式</strong>（例如 <a style=\"color:#999\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aerobatic-elytra-jetpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aerobatic Elytra Jetpack</a>）</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可自定义物理参数</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">📋 <strong>数据包特性</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组的某些功能可以通过数据包配置，因为它们涉及战利品表或配方。为使这些功能更容易获得，该模组附带了<a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/endorh/aerobatic-elytra/wiki/Bundled-Datapacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">内置数据包</a>，你可轻松使用<span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;color:#999\">/aerobaticelytra datapack install</span>命令安装：</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在<strong>末地船</strong>中生成 Aerobatic Elytras（本模组暴露了一个新的<strong>末地船战利品表</strong>）</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通过<strong>升级系统</strong>削弱 Aerobatic Elytras（更改提升 Aerobatic Elytras 所需的材料）</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">为鞘翅添加<strong>自定义药水效果能力</strong>（效果可依赖于战利品条件，并可通过你的自定义配方解锁）</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">🎮 <strong>控制方式</strong></span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">按 <strong>C</strong> 键切换飞行模式（原版/特技）</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在空中按<strong>跳跃</strong>开始飞行（如同普通鞘翅）</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">按<strong>前进</strong>加速</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">按<strong>上下看</strong>调整俯仰角度（可反转）</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">按<strong>左右看</strong>使飞机左/右滚转</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">按<strong>左右移动</strong>使飞机左/右转弯（极慢，建议通过滚转来转向）</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在全速冲刺获得临时<strong>加速</strong></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">按<strong>蹲下</strong>刹车</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">飞行时长按<strong>跳跃</strong>修正航向（可用于直线飞行或微调航向）</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">长按<strong>Alt</strong>在飞行时环顾四周</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">双击<strong>Alt</strong>在控制飞行的同时保持环顾视野（探索时很有用）</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">切换飞行模式（C）和环顾视角（Alt）的按键可更改。其余操作取决于你的移动设置，应该已符合你的偏好。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📜 Fabric?</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我计划将此模组移植到 Fabric，但首先需要移植它依赖的模组，主要是 <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Config</a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📦 依赖项</strong></span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lazulib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lazulib</a></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Config</a></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#a0a0a0\">[仅限 1.16-1.19] </span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#bdbdbd\"><a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#bdbdbd\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flight-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flight Core</a></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#a0a0a0\">[可选]</span> <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#a0a0a0\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/distant-horizons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Distant Horizons</a></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#a0a0a0\">[可选]</span> <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#a0a0a0\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aerobatic-elytra-jetpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aerobatic Elytra Jetpack</a></span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🔀 模组整合</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Aerobatic Elyta 与以下模组合成（详见 <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/endorh/aerobatic-elytra/wiki/Compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>）：</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a> 可显示精确的 Aerobatic Elytras 合成配方</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a>（需要 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caelus</a> 以及 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/endorh/aerobatic-elytra/wiki/Compatibility#curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">一些设置</a>）</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#a0a0a0\">[1.17+ 存在 Bug] </span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#bdbdbd\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/colytra\" rel=\"nofollow\">Colytra</a> 可将 Aerobatic Elytra 与胸甲修复在一起</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">❓ <strong>帮助</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">该模组拥有一篇 <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/endorh/aerobaticelytra/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>，其中包含有关飞行的实用技巧，并描述了如何按你的喜好配置此模组。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你遇到任何问题，或只是想打个招呼，欢迎访问我们的 <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://discord.gg/gqYVjBq65U\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">🤝 <strong>支持本项目</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你想支持本项目，请与你的朋友分享它！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 图片</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g6WRyGF.png\" alt=\"Flying with Aerobatic Elytra\" width=\"640\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a2acbWf.png\" alt=\"Sailing the clounds upside-down\" width=\"640\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LRAMfcm.png\" alt=\"Flying underwater\" width=\"640\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8Y3zEHO.png\" alt=\"Flight Crosshair\" width=\"640\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/X2EvqXp.png\" alt=\"Rectifying flight crosshair\" width=\"640\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q8b3Noh.png\" alt=\"Detached look around crosshair\" width=\"640\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Gb6D7NF.png\" alt=\"Walking on walls\" width=\"640\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BmqfXJa.png\" alt=\"Expanded wings (crouching)\" width=\"640\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7p5l8nQ.png\" alt=\"Folded wings (standing)\" width=\"640\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n3WwxTc.png\" alt=\"Rolling in the air\" width=\"640\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fv0a1xl.png\" alt=\"Dyed elytras\" width=\"640\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9TNllQE.png\" alt=\"Customized trail\" width=\"640\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DZI1P9X.png\" alt=\"JEI recipes\" width=\"640\"></p>",
